cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository or the accompanying manuscript, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Scale Geometry of Complex Systems: Repository and Manuscript Artifacts"
version: "2.2"
type: software
license: "MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Theclimateguy/Shroedinger"
url: "https://github.com/Theclimateguy/Shroedinger"
date-released: 2026-04-14
authors:
  - family-names: "Sotiriadi"
    given-names: "N."
abstract: >-
  Repository accompanying the manuscript "Scale Geometry of Complex Systems:
  Formalism and Empirical Verification of Local Lambda_b--Pi_b Closure in
  Atmospheric Data". The work introduces a gauge-invariant functional
  Lambda_matter and tests the local Lambda_b ~ Pi_b closure in controlled toy
  models and ERA5 atmospheric data, with the main atmospheric result
  R^2_binned = 0.520 in the inertial range. The manuscript was originally
  written in Russian and is distributed here together with its English
  translation.
keywords:
  - scale geometry
  - multiscale systems
  - atmospheric dynamics
  - ERA5
  - renormalization group
  - gauge invariance
  - Hilbert bundle
  - climate
